/test/  <email redacted>   # Troy Goode: 420 of 820 non-blank lines (51.2%), 517 of 966 counting blank lines (53.5%)
# /.github/: nobody holds half. Top is Douglas Christopher Wilson, 92 lines (30.2%) / 118 counting blank lines (32.2%)
